<title>UK: Shell Netherlands refinery back to normal.</title>
<headline>Shell Netherlands refinery back to normal.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-02-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Production at the Shell Netherlands 370,000 barrels per day (bpd) Rotterdam refinery is back to normal after technical problems which began last week, a Shell trader said on Tuesday.</p>
<p>&quot;All units are back to normal,&quot; he said.</p>
<p>Shell Netherlands bought an extra 55,000 tonnes of fuel oil in the ARA barge market last week as a result of the problems. Shell has declined to reveal the exact nature of the problems.</p>
<p>-- London newsroom +44 171 542 8167</p>
</text>
